{"vector":"provider.ndjson","domain":"v2-provider","note":"Provider 角色的派发 / 回帧 / 在线广播（spec/12-provider.md）。域 v2-provider：只有**带 Provider 角色**的实现参与回放（C# 主机），冻结在 v1 的 Dart 参考实现与 Kotlin 客户端不参与。"}
{"step":1,"title":"配对一个普通设备（发起识别的那一端）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/pair","auth":"none","json":{"code":"$pairingCode","device_id":"android-device-1","device_name":"Pixel 7","platform":"android","app_version":"1.0.0"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"capture":{"token":"$.token"}}}
{"step":2,"title":"再配对一个 Provider 设备（它的令牌给 role=provider 的那条连接用）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/pair","auth":"none","json":{"code":"$pairingCode","device_id":"windows-provider-1","device_name":"TIOPWXNL","platform":"windows","app_version":"2.0.0"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"capture":{"providerToken":"$.token"}}}
{"step":3,"title":"主机已建合集并选中（任务必须落在合集里，否则 409 no_active_collection）","do":{"seed":{"collection":{"id":"c-prov","name":"Provider 验收"},"active_collection":"c-prov"}}}
{"step":4,"title":"普通客户端连上 /ws（Authorization: Bearer <token>）","do":{"ws":{"connect":"device"}}}
{"step":5,"title":"服务端先发 hello：server_device_id 是**主机自己**的 id，并带上当前合集","do":{"ws":{"expect":{"type":"hello","server_device_id":"server-device-1","protocol_version":1,"active_collection_id":"c-prov","active_collection_name":"Provider 验收"}}}}
{"step":6,"title":"客户端回一条 hello（device_id / app_version / platform）","do":{"ws":{"send":{"type":"hello","device_id":"android-device-1","app_version":"1.0.0","platform":"android"}}}}
{"step":7,"title":"Provider 用**自己的令牌**另开一条连接，并在握手里自述 role / ai_configured / ai_provider / ai_model","do":{"ws":{"connect":"provider"}}}
{"step":8,"title":"Provider 那条连接也会先收到 hello（广播面与角色无关）","do":{"ws":{"target":"provider","expect":{"type":"hello","server_device_id":"server-device-1","protocol_version":1}}}}
{"step":9,"title":"登记成功 → 广播 provider_online{online:true}；ai_configured / ai_model 取 **Provider 自述值**（主机自己没配 AI）","do":{"ws":{"expect":{"type":"provider_online","online":true,"ai_configured":true,"ai_model":"deepseek-chat"}}}}
{"step":10,"title":"同一帧也广播给 Provider 自己（广播面不按角色过滤）","do":{"ws":{"target":"provider","expect":{"type":"provider_online","online":true}}}}
{"step":11,"title":"Provider 在线时 /api/v2/info 的加法字段跟着变","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v2/info","auth":"none"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"provider_online":true,"provider_model":"deepseek-chat"}}}
{"step":12,"title":"上传一张图（内容寻址）→ 拿到 image_hash","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/images","auth":"device","multipart":{"field":"file","bytes":1024,"filename":"a.jpg"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"existed":false},"capture":{"imageHash":"$.image_hash"}}}
{"step":13,"title":"建任务 → 202 queued（有 Provider 在线时不会停在 queued 等着）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/tasks","auth":"device","json":{"task_id":"t-prov-1","image_hash":"$imageHash","image_hashes":["$imageHash"],"source_device":"android-device-1"}}},"expect":{"status":202,"json":{"status":"queued"},"json_regex":{"session_id":"^[0-9a-f-]{36}$"},"capture":{"sessionId":"$.session_id"}}}
{"step":14,"title":"主机把作业**定向单播**给 Provider：键恒在、页面顺序就是 image_hashes 下标顺序；顺便 capture job_id","do":{"ws":{"target":"provider","expect":{"type":"recognition_job","task_id":"t-prov-1","session_id":"$sessionId","collection_id":"c-prov","image_hashes":["$imageHash"],"deadline_ms":90000},"max_ms":10000,"capture":{"jobId":"$.job_id"}}}}
{"step":15,"title":"派发同时进入 analyzing 并广播 task_update（客户端据此显示「电脑正在识别」）","do":{"ws":{"expect":{"type":"task_update","task_id":"t-prov-1","status":"analyzing"}}}}
{"step":16,"title":"Provider 回成功帧：questions[] 用**数据库列名**，JSON 文本列原样透传","do":{"ws":{"target":"provider","send":{"type":"recognition_result","job_id":"$jobId","ok":true,"ai_provider":"openai-compatible","ai_model":"deepseek-chat","latency_ms":2381,"questions":[{"ordinal":0,"question_no":"第 7 题","stem":"下列说法正确的是","material":"材料：某工厂把 20% 的利润投入研发……","type":"single","options_json":"[{\"label\":\"A\",\"text\":\"甲\"},{\"label\":\"B\",\"text\":\"乙\"}]","choice_json":"[\"A\"]","analysis":"解析：由材料可知选 A","confidence":0.92,"need_review":0,"answer_in_image":0,"incomplete":0,"answer_guessed":0,"warnings_json":"[\"题干疑似截断\"]"}]}}}}
{"step":17,"title":"认领后任务落 done（题目落库与列级往返由下一步的 task_result 会话证明）","do":{"poll":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/tasks/t-prov-1","auth":"device","until":{"status":"done"},"max_ms":20000,"interval_ms":100}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"status":"done"}}}
{"step":18,"title":"主机把结果推给普通客户端：会话 1 道题，模型与耗时都来自 Provider 的自述","do":{"ws":{"expect":{"type":"task_result","task_id":"t-prov-1","session":{"session_id":"$sessionId","status":"done","question_count":1,"ai_model":"deepseek-chat","latency_ms":2381}}}}}
{"step":19,"title":"上传**另一张**图（换 hash：同图同页序会命中结果复用，就不会再派发新作业）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/images","auth":"device","multipart":{"field":"file","bytes":2048,"filename":"b.jpg"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"existed":false},"capture":{"imageHash2":"$.image_hash"}}}
{"step":20,"title":"再建一个任务，用于验证失败帧","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/tasks","auth":"device","json":{"task_id":"t-prov-2","image_hash":"$imageHash2","image_hashes":["$imageHash2"],"source_device":"android-device-1"}}},"expect":{"status":202,"json":{"status":"queued"}}}
{"step":21,"title":"这次的派发帧（capture 到 jobId2 供下一步回帧用）","do":{"ws":{"target":"provider","expect":{"type":"recognition_job","task_id":"t-prov-2"},"max_ms":10000,"capture":{"jobId2":"$.job_id"}}}}
{"step":22,"title":"Provider 报错：ok=false + 协议码表内的 error_code 原样采用","do":{"ws":{"target":"provider","send":{"type":"recognition_result","job_id":"$jobId2","ok":false,"error_code":"ai_auth","error_message":"主机尚未配置 AI"}}}}
{"step":23,"title":"任务落 failed + ai_auth（不是 ai_timeout，也不是假的成功）","do":{"poll":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/tasks/t-prov-2","auth":"device","until":{"status":"failed"},"max_ms":20000,"interval_ms":100}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"status":"failed","error_code":"ai_auth"}}}
{"step":24,"title":"Provider 掉线（客户端主动关闭那条连接）","do":{"ws":{"target":"provider","close":true}}}
{"step":25,"title":"掉线 → 广播 provider_online{online:false}，ai_configured / ai_model 回到 false / null（键恒在）","do":{"ws":{"expect":{"type":"provider_online","online":false,"ai_configured":false,"ai_model":null}}}}
{"step":26,"title":"第三张图（同样是为了绕开结果复用）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/images","auth":"device","multipart":{"field":"file","bytes":3072,"filename":"c.jpg"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"existed":false},"capture":{"imageHash3":"$.image_hash"}}}
{"step":27,"title":"没有 Provider 在线时再建任务：**不停在 queued 等**，而是快速失败","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/tasks","auth":"device","json":{"task_id":"t-prov-3","image_hash":"$imageHash3","image_hashes":["$imageHash3"],"source_device":"android-device-1"}}},"expect":{"status":202}}
{"step":28,"title":"任务落 failed + provider_offline（客户端据此提示「电脑上的识别服务没开」）","do":{"poll":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/tasks/t-prov-3","auth":"device","until":{"status":"failed"},"max_ms":5000,"interval_ms":100}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"status":"failed","error_code":"provider_offline"}}}
